    "$comment": "`faces` are the text faces, subset to `unicodes` via the pinned host fontTools (--no-recalc-timestamp --no-recalc-bounds). `keepUnsubset` ship whole: mathtext's dejavusans fontset probes every one of these fallback families (sized delimiters, \\mathcal, cm set) — missing families spam findfont warnings into user output — and their glyph lookups (STIXNonUni rides the PUA) are fragile under subsetting.",
